 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the beginning God created the heavens and the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The earth was formless and empty",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Darkness lay over the face of the deep",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Spirit of God hovered over the face of the waters",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God said, Let there be light, and there was light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And there was evening, and there was morning",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spread the vault among the waters and he named the heavens high",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gathered seas into one place, and the dry land met the sky",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land brought forth its green growth, every seed and fruit and tree",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set the lights to rule the day and night, and stars for all to see",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God said, Let there be light, and there was light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And there was evening, and there was morning",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The waters teemed with living creatures and the birds took to the air",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The great sea creatures filled the deep, and life was everywhere",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The livestock and the wild things and the creeping things that roam",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each according to its kind, and the earth became their home",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So God created man in his own image",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the image of God he created him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Male and female he created them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "God saw all that he had made, and behold, it was very good",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "On the seventh day he rested from all the work he had done",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then God blessed the seventh day and made it holy",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good",
